<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">识别</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">拍照或说话，查找杂草与农药资料</view>

  <view class="notice" wx:if="{{guest}}">
    <text class="notice__icon">🔒</text>
    <text class="notice__text">您正在以游客身份浏览，登录后才能实际使用识别与语音功能。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="mode" wx:for="{{modes}}" wx:key="key">
    <view class="mode__head">
      <text class="mode__icon">{{item.icon}}</text>
      <view class="mode__body">
        <view class="mode__title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="mode__desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn--primary mode__btn" disabled="{{guest}}" bindtap="onShoot">
      {{item.action}}
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">语音提问</view>
    <view class="card-text">
      录音与播放分成两个按钮：先点录音，说完再点播放回听。这样不会在说话时误触覆盖，也不会把录音直接发出去。
    </view>
    <view class="voice-row">
      <button class="btn btn--primary voice-btn" disabled="{{guest}}" bindtap="onRecord">
        {{recording ? '录音中…' : '开始录音'}}
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn--secondary voice-btn" disabled="{{guest || !hasRecording}}" bindtap="onPlay">
        播放录音
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="voice-hint" wx:if="{{!hasRecording}}">还没有录音。录音功能尚未接入，此处仅演示按钮布局。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">服务状态</view>
  <state-view
    status="stub"
    title="识别能力未接入"
    desc="拍草识别、标签识别、语音转写与大模型问答均未接入真实服务，页面不会采集照片或录音。识别结果将在后续任务中逐项替换。"
  ></state-view>
</view>
